  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.11 - Image and text to 3D (TRELLIS.2: photo or prompt -> PBR GLB) on CUDA (tensor cores), OpenCL, CPU and in the browser on WebGPU (portable tiled GEMM + flash attention, device mesh clustering, checkpoint streaming / per-file OPFS caching, background pipeline builds). Face detection and recognition (YuNet + SFace, matched against OpenCV). Requires SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.8. See CHANGELOG.md.",
